  <wpt lat="54.807159" lon="-1.315036"><name>#1 Hawthorn Hive</name><desc>Score 75. a bridge or viaduct nearby; slopes, banks or cliffs to dive; a beach: open sand to carry speed along the water. Not A3-clear: houses, businesses or a park within 150 m, so an 800 g quad is outside the Open A3 rules here. A sub-250 g drone can fly it under A1. Warnings: Nature reserve or SSSI: byelaws often ban drones; watch for nesting birds; Railway within 30 m: stay well clear of the line</desc><sym>Flag</sym></wpt>
